{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1313711-neoplatonism-gnostism-and-hermetism-in-scion","id":1313711,"title":"Neoplatonism, Gnostism, and Hermetism in Scion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-05-22T11:40:41-07:00","id":1313711,"title":"Neoplatonism, Gnostism, and Hermetism in Scion","content":"How would you guess handle Neoplatonism, Gnostism and Hermetism in Scion 2e?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-22T13:57:56-07:00","id":1313738,"title":"","content":"If you mean magic with big effects, same level as the Marvels, I have an adaptation os Hermetic Magic from Ars Magica to Storypath (specifically Trinity, but easy to adapt).<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1295036-hermetic-magic-for-storypath\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...-for-storypath</a><br /> <br /> If you think about it on a more subtle way, closer to the magic concepts in real world Gnostism and Hermeticism, than you must think them as part of the Occult Skill. How exactly it would work depends on how much flavour and how much flash you want magic have.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-23T06:52:52-07:00","id":1313838,"title":"","content":"I was actually more refering to Theologically. The Neoplatonic conception/theological understanding of the Gods such as the Theoi is very different the Epic Poems.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-23T08:31:05-07:00","id":1313858,"title":"","content":"They exist. Nothing really changes aside from there being figures that some other people call gods. Some gnostic groups see the gods as archons of the demiurge.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-23T14:13:55-07:00","id":1313905,"title":"","content":"The Gnostics revere Aeons, perhaps an Aeon Pantheon would be interesting, much less Anthromorphized. <br /> <br /> Neoplatonism is different from Gnostism, the Gods of various Pantheons are worshipped by the Neoplatonists. But the Gods have Archangels and Angels, Cosmic and Hylic Archons, and more in Neoplatonism. <br /> <br /> Hermetism is similar. <br /> <br /> I would love to see a supplement on these deep religions and their applications to Scion 2e.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-24T14:04:44-07:00","id":1314163,"title":"","content":"Nothing really changes adding an Aeon Pantheon, unless there's ALSO a Mal'akhim Pantheon - we don't really have another example of 2 different Pantheons built on the same mythic foundation with opposing cosmological views like that. Do you include the Demiurge as a distinct figure in the Aeon cosmology? Or are they just at odds with the Mal'akhim and their chief divinity as being the Demiurge? If the Fallen of Christian Demonology also exist, how do they play into this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T18:54:02-07:00","id":1314864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1313711-neoplatonism-gnostism-and-hermetism-in-scion?p=1314163#post1314163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nothing really changes adding an Aeon Pantheon, unless there's ALSO a Mal'akhim Pantheon - we don't really have another example of 2 different Pantheons built on the same mythic foundation with opposing cosmological views like that. Do you include the Demiurge as a distinct figure in the Aeon cosmology? Or are they just at odds with the Mal'akhim and their chief divinity as being the Demiurge? If the Fallen of Christian Demonology also exist, how do they play into this?</div> </div> </div> </div>All good questions. I curious how devs would handle it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T18:59:21-07:00","id":1314865,"title":"","content":"I had to look up the Mal'akhim, it's means angels I believe. If you have both a Mal'akhim and Aeons Pantheons, and a Hypercosmic Pantheon that would be interesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T19:01:37-07:00","id":1314866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1313711-neoplatonism-gnostism-and-hermetism-in-scion?p=1314864#post1314864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> All good questions. I curious how devs would handle it.</div> </div> </div> </div>How the devs would handle it is \u201cnot touching it with a ten foot pole\u201d.<br /> <br /> We are in homebrew country.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T19:04:01-07:00","id":1314867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1313711-neoplatonism-gnostism-and-hermetism-in-scion?p=1314865#post1314865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I had to look up the Mal'akhim, it's means angels I believe. If you have both a Mal'akhim and Aeons Pantheons, and a Hypercosmic Pantheon that would be interesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>If I understand what you are referencing with the term \u201chypercosmic\u201d, that\u2019s in the realm of philosophy well outside the purview of myth and legend, and thus would not have a distinct pantheon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-29T08:21:28-07:00","id":1315177,"title":"","content":"It interacts with Mythology. Neoplatonism was the unification of ancient Mythology, Theology, Philosophy, ect...<br /> <br /> It was based on a mix of the Chaldean Oracles, Orphitism and other myster religion teachings with philosodphical teachings, obviously Plato, but with Neopythagreons, Stoics, and Aristolian influences ect...<br /> <br /> It did refer at times to Mythology.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}